ppy, carefree 14 year old Akane Isshiki lived a poor, but well loved life together with her reliable little sister, Momo, who does all the housework, and her grandfather, Kenjirou, a genius inventor who only created useless devices. When the weather is clear, they can see the artificial island, Blue Island, across the sea. In the center of that island rises the revolutionary Manifestation Engine, a discovery that solved the world's energy problems.<br><br>\nIt is a peaceful future, just like everyone dreamed of. One where everyone can smile and be happy...<br><br>\nBut suddenly, the world is visited by danger. An unknown enemy, the Alone, appear, targeting the Manifestation Engine. As none of their weapons worked and they fell into despair, a lone girl takes a stand wearing a red \"Palette Suit\" which wields a great, hidden power. Before long, allies gather around her to fight.<br><br>\nAnd their friendship becomes the only hope for saving the world!<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":3,"year":2013},"episodes":12,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Crunchyroll","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.crunchyroll.com/vividred-operation"}],"genres":["Action","Ecchi","Mahou Shoujo","Sci-Fi"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":60,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":87,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2013},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":20,"season":"WINTER","type":"RATED","year":2013},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":16,"season":"WINTER","type":"POPULAR","year":2013}],"relations":[["ADAPTATION",78687,48687,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2013,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":11,"month":1,"year":2013},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":143,"score":10},{"amount":172,"score":20},{"amount":324,"score":30},{"amount":483,"score":40},{"amount":966,"score":50},{